      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an unbearable weight, and the desire for the noise and the struggle to simply stop is a cry for profound relief. If you are having thoughts of ending your life, please know that there are people who want to support you through this immediate crisis. You can connect with the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada. Please reach out to them right now.",
      "source": "target",
